Players can earn '''Fame Ranks''' by contributing to [[City Projects|city projects]] and spending [[SkyBlock Bits|Bits]] and [[SkyBlock Gems|Gems]] with [[Elizabeth]].

== Earning Fame ==
Players can earn Fame in the following ways:
* 1 Fame per [[Bits|Bit]] spent at Elizabeth
* 200 Fame per [[SkyBlock Gems|Gem]] spent in the community shop
* 200 Fame for every contribution made to a [[City Project|city project]]
** Some city project contributions may provide additional Fame bonuses.

Fame is account-wide and transfers across profiles. The player's current progress can be viewed in the {{code|/boostercookie}} menu.

